{
  "chapters": [
    {
      "label": "The site entrance",
      "title": "A world of possibility.",
      "emphasis": "possibility.",
      "text": "Beyond the site gates, a new space begins. Follow the journey from open ground to considered architecture.",
      "detail": "01 / Arrival · Site & setting"
    },
    {
      "label": "Excavation",
      "title": "Begin below the surface.",
      "emphasis": "surface.",
      "text": "Earth is opened, levels are established and the bearing ground is prepared. Every structure begins with what lies beneath.",
      "detail": "02 / Earthworks · Excavation & levels"
    },
    {
      "label": "Foundations",
      "title": "Strength from the ground.",
      "emphasis": "ground.",
      "text": "Prepared bases, reinforcement and connected footings establish the footprint. Precision below ground supports everything above.",
      "detail": "03 / Foundations · Footings & reinforcement"
    },
    {
      "label": "Structural framework",
      "title": "The first lines of form.",
      "emphasis": "form.",
      "text": "Steel cages and concrete columns trace the structural grid. A drawing begins to occupy real space.",
      "detail": "04 / Framework · Steel & concrete"
    },
    {
      "label": "Concrete & formwork",
      "title": "Space takes shape.",
      "emphasis": "shape.",
      "text": "Temporary supports hold the work while beams and slabs define each level. Materials, machinery and sequence work together.",
      "detail": "05 / Concrete · Columns, beams & slabs"
    },
    {
      "label": "Engineering detail",
      "title": "Precision in every connection.",
      "emphasis": "connection.",
      "text": "Look closer at reinforcement, ties and the junctions between elements. Small details belong to a much larger whole.",
      "detail": "06 / Connections · Reinforcement & coordination"
    },
    {
      "label": "Rising above",
      "title": "A new perspective.",
      "emphasis": "perspective.",
      "text": "The camera rises beyond the first structure. Ahead, a multi-storey frame reveals the rhythm of repeated floors and an emerging skyline.",
      "detail": "07 / Vertical progress · Structure & scale"
    },
    {
      "label": "The upper floors",
      "title": "Building towards the sky.",
      "emphasis": "sky.",
      "text": "Upper floor plates, a service core and roof reinforcement complete the structural silhouette. The crane connects ground operations to the work above.",
      "detail": "08 / Upper levels · Slabs & lifting"
    },
    {
      "label": "The building envelope",
      "title": "Character in the making.",
      "emphasis": "making.",
      "text": "Scaffolding follows the facade. Stone panels, glazing and shaded openings begin to turn the frame into architecture.",
      "detail": "09 / Envelope · Facade installation"
    },
    {
      "label": "Architectural finishing",
      "title": "Every surface considered.",
      "emphasis": "considered.",
      "text": "Recessed joints, metal screens and carefully resolved edges bring depth and texture to the exterior.",
      "detail": "10 / Finishing · Material & proportion"
    },
    {
      "label": "The arrival landscape",
      "title": "A place comes together.",
      "emphasis": "together.",
      "text": "Paths meet entrances. Planting softens the edge of the building. The surrounding spaces complete the experience of arrival.",
      "detail": "11 / Setting · Landscape & approach"
    },
    {
      "label": "The completed vision",
      "title": "A vision, made tangible.",
      "emphasis": "tangible.",
      "text": "From the first excavation to the final facade, each stage has shaped the whole. Explore the Spoorthi approach and architectural concept collection.",
      "detail": "12 / Architecture · The completed concept"
    }
  ],
